Package: openjp3d
Type: Package
Title: R Bindings for the OpenJP3D Volumetric Codec
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-02-21
Authors@R: person("OpenJP3D Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "openjp3d@raster-lab.example.com")
Description: Pure R bindings for the OpenJP3D shared library, providing
    lossless and lossy compression of 3-D image volumes using JPEG 2000
    Part 10 (JP3D / ISO/IEC 15444-10).  Encode and decode volumetric data
    directly from R integer arrays without requiring a separate compilation
    step beyond the standard R package build.  Supports optional HTJ2K
    high-throughput block coding (JPEG 2000 Part 15).
License: BSD_2_clause + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Raster-Lab/OpenJP3D
BugReports: https://github.com/Raster-Lab/OpenJP3D/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
